`benchmark.meta description: Runs line-path intersections where bounds reject most work.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: graphics,compile-timing

/graphics/intersection
/graphics/path
/graphics/point
/graphics/shapes

. path = circle((120, 120), 45)
. checksum = 0 as Size

for pass in 0 .. < 1200
    . f = pass as Float
    . hits = intersect-path-line(path, (300 + f, 20), (320 + f, 260))
    checksum += hits.length + pass

-- "bench-result graphics/intersect-line-path-reject checksum=$checksum"
